            "contentString": "The documented nonmetastatic triple-negative breast cancer with clinically positive nodes or at least clinical T1c disease meets the supplied neoadjuvant guidance criterion for oncology review. This does not establish chemotherapy fitness or authorize a medication order. The ASCO 2022 immunotherapy update concerns a distinct high-risk population; this review trigger does not determine pembrolizumab eligibility."
